WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.130 --> 00:00:03.000
- Woo hoo!
(howls and trills tongue)

00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:04.678
(laughter)
(cadence lypso music)

00:00:07.138 --> 00:00:09.940
- Is it pronounced Cuh-rib-ih-yun,
or Care-rib-bee-yun?

00:00:09.940 --> 00:00:10.784
- I didn't know jerk chicken

00:00:10.784 --> 00:00:12.421
was a part of the Caribbean aspect.

00:00:12.421 --> 00:00:13.871
I had some jerk chicken wings--

00:00:13.871 --> 00:00:15.301
- Oh so now he wants to
say he had jerk chicken.

00:00:15.301 --> 00:00:17.212
- No Buffalo Wild Wings got
some good jerk chicken sauce.

00:00:17.212 --> 00:00:18.087
- That is not Caribbean.

00:00:18.087 --> 00:00:20.618
- I know this is not accurate,
but I think of tourists

00:00:20.618 --> 00:00:21.923
and tiki drinks.

00:00:21.923 --> 00:00:24.614
- I am expecting just a
lot of beauty in my mouth,

00:00:24.614 --> 00:00:26.058
lot of good stuff in my mouth.

00:00:26.058 --> 00:00:29.505
(cadence lypso music)

00:00:29.505 --> 00:00:30.722
- [Man in Minuteman shirt]
So it looks like a crepe.

00:00:30.722 --> 00:00:32.671
- It's glistening in oil.
- Yeah.

00:00:32.671 --> 00:00:34.766
- It looks like a burnt pancake.

00:00:34.766 --> 00:00:38.038
(chewing noises)

00:00:38.038 --> 00:00:39.280
- I like this one.

00:00:39.280 --> 00:00:42.744
- It's not bad, but it's not
that good either. (laughter)

00:00:43.414 --> 00:00:44.268
- It tastes bad.

00:00:44.268 --> 00:00:45.451
- The more you taste it though...

00:00:45.451 --> 00:00:46.931
- The more it kind of gets good.

00:00:46.931 --> 00:00:47.961
- It like grows on you.

00:00:47.961 --> 00:00:49.443
- Yeah it was like, okay, yeah.

00:00:49.443 --> 00:00:50.829
- I guess it is like from
Barbados, like Rihanna.

00:00:50.829 --> 00:00:52.347
The more she sings, it's like, yeah okay.

00:00:52.347 --> 00:00:53.731
- Yeah, okay, I'll rock with it.

00:00:53.731 --> 00:00:58.715
(cadence lypso music)

00:00:59.605 --> 00:01:00.550
- It looks like something you'd find

00:01:00.550 --> 00:01:01.734
at the bottom of the ocean.

00:01:01.734 --> 00:01:03.069
- It looks like chicken pot pie.

00:01:03.069 --> 00:01:06.575
- Yes, it also kind of
looks like a pineapple taco.

00:01:06.575 --> 00:01:08.258
- Reminds me a little bit of Indian,

00:01:08.258 --> 00:01:09.675
just like the consistency.

00:01:09.675 --> 00:01:10.495
- Yes, definitely.

00:01:10.495 --> 00:01:12.356
- Not going to lie, this
actually blew my mind.

00:01:12.356 --> 00:01:13.712
- [Man in Status Quo
shirt] It's pretty good.

00:01:13.712 --> 00:01:16.608
(cadence lypso music)

00:01:16.608 --> 00:01:17.607
- It smells fried.

00:01:17.607 --> 00:01:20.103
- This looks like a doughnut,
and I love doughnuts.

00:01:20.103 --> 00:01:22.978
- When I first bit into it,
I had this pastry feeling.

00:01:22.978 --> 00:01:24.448
- This would be a good sandwich almost--

00:01:24.448 --> 00:01:25.548
- Yeah.

00:01:25.548 --> 00:01:26.682
- If you put something in this.

00:01:26.682 --> 00:01:29.224
- This is a very dense ball of dough.

00:01:29.224 --> 00:01:30.815
- I would eat this, all the time.

00:01:30.815 --> 00:01:32.888
- Oh RIhanna looks she would
probably eat something--

00:01:32.888 --> 00:01:34.714
- Rihanna looked like
she might make these.

00:01:34.714 --> 00:01:38.065
- She likes meaty, whole
round things, I feel like.

00:01:38.065 --> 00:01:42.816
(cadence lypso music)

00:01:43.016 --> 00:01:43.941
- It's oxtail.

00:01:43.941 --> 00:01:45.447
- Oh.

00:01:45.447 --> 00:01:47.165
- This looks so delicious to me.

00:01:47.165 --> 00:01:48.930
- You can make plate art with it.

00:01:48.930 --> 00:01:51.039
- It just kind of looks like a turd.

00:01:51.039 --> 00:01:52.755
(pleased humming)

00:01:52.755 --> 00:01:54.496
- It has a nice little glaze on it.

00:01:54.496 --> 00:01:56.737
- It's sweet, kind of like a pot roast.

00:01:56.737 --> 00:01:58.508
- I like how tender it is.

00:01:59.648 --> 00:02:00.143
- Oxtail?

00:02:00.143 --> 00:02:03.093
(laughter)

00:02:03.563 --> 00:02:05.017
- I love this, this is great.

00:02:05.017 --> 00:02:09.877
(cadence lypso music)

00:02:10.257 --> 00:02:11.607
- It smells Cinnamon-ey.

00:02:11.607 --> 00:02:14.336
- Oh, that's not rice, that's coconut.

00:02:14.336 --> 00:02:15.914
- That's coconut?!

00:02:15.914 --> 00:02:16.933
- Oh, I hate jello.

00:02:16.933 --> 00:02:18.256
Is this jello?

00:02:18.256 --> 00:02:19.592
- It melts in your mouth.

00:02:19.592 --> 00:02:21.193
- It feels like I'm eating a Teletubby.

00:02:21.193 --> 00:02:22.722
- Rihanna, this one is not going to do.

00:02:22.722 --> 00:02:24.160
Don't pass this out at the concert.

00:02:24.160 --> 00:02:26.135
- They have interesting
textural things going on.

00:02:26.135 --> 00:02:27.150
- That's very true.

00:02:27.150 --> 00:02:28.267
- Everything is delicious, I love it.

00:02:28.267 --> 00:02:30.750
I will go and visit you guys
and eat all of your food.

00:02:30.750 --> 00:02:33.160
- I would definitely get
back on some of that oxtail,

00:02:33.160 --> 00:02:35.559
and the con-fung-blok-tay, (spoken over).

00:02:35.559 --> 00:02:37.851
- I'm pretty sure that's
not how you say it.

00:02:37.851 --> 00:02:39.728
- We need to go on a
trip to the Caribbean.

00:02:39.728 --> 00:02:41.106
- As long as you're paying.

00:02:41.106 --> 00:02:44.377
- Cheers. (laughter)

00:02:44.377 --> 00:02:47.682
- Shout out to Rihanna, shout
out to all the Caribbeans.

00:02:47.682 --> 00:02:50.767
Shout out to Johnny Depp and
the Pirates of the Caribbean.

00:02:50.767 --> 00:02:55.401
(upbeat cadence lypso music)

